i## How it works	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
iThe system is intentionally quite simple. The chain of	/	tilde.team	70
iGopherspaces is stored persistently using SQLite3. Users can	/	tilde.team	70
iperform operations on the webring via Gopher requests	/	tilde.team	70
ispecifying specific paths. Each node of the webring has a	/	tilde.team	70
iunique ID and a unique token. The token can be used by the	/	tilde.team	70
iusers to remove their gopherspace from the webring.	/	tilde.team	70
hSQLite3	URL:https://sqlite.org/	sqlite.org	443
i	/	tilde.team	70
iFor more technical details, please refer to the project	/	tilde.team	70
idocumentation.	/	tilde.team	70
hproject documentation	URL:https://github.com/theobori/ange/blob/main/README.md	github.com	443
i	/	tilde.team	70
i### Webring members	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
iAfter submitting a request to join the webring, the idea is	/	tilde.team	70
ifor users to add a section representing their node in the	/	tilde.team	70
iwebring to their website. Here is an example.	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
i1Previous    /webring/previous/your_id    webring-url    70	/	tilde.team	70
i1Webring title    /    webring-url    70	/	tilde.team	70
i1Next    /webring/next/your_id    webring-url    70	/	tilde.team	70
i1Random    /webring/random    webring-url    70	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
i## Accessibility	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
iAnge provides a set of features that make it easy to create	/	tilde.team	70
iand manage your own webring. It follows the same approach as	/	tilde.team	70
ithe fleur project. It is easy to understand and very simple	/	tilde.team	70
ito set up.	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
iSpecifically, someone wishing to use ange to create a Gopher	/	tilde.team	70
iwebring would simply need to install ange on their machine	/	tilde.team	70
iusing the command line recommended in the project	/	tilde.team	70
idocumentation. Then, if necessary, customize the file named	/	tilde.team	70
igophermap in the root of the chosen directory, and finally	/	tilde.team	70
irun ange.	/	tilde.team	70
i	/	tilde.team	70
